# NOT plugin/: .claude/skills/severity-rubric is a symlink into
# plugin/skills/severity-rubric (see M7) — excluding plugin/ from the
# build context would leave that symlink dangling in the image and
# silently break the judge's Skill-tool lookup for containerized `audit`.
